# The node's own web certificate, and the key under it.
#
# The proxy pins to its fingerprint, so a new certificate is a node the proxy
# does not recognise - no config mode until the node has provisioned itself
# again and reported the new one.
#
# uhttpd lists both in its conffiles, but apk only records conffiles the
# package actually ships, and these are made at runtime by px5g - so they are
# in no conffiles_static and sysupgrade would leave them behind. Saying so here
# is what keeps them.
/etc/uhttpd.crt
/etc/uhttpd.key
